ative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Candidates can download it from the official JCECEB website under the <strong data-end=\"567\" data-start=\"551\">\u201canswer key\u201d</strong> section</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Is it mandatory to<strong> carry the admit card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: Yes, the admit card is compulsory for entry into the examination hall.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>JCECEB</strong></span>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>JCECEB </strong></span>is <strong>https://jceceb.jharkhand.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"JCECEB Jharkhand BEd Answer Key 2026\" class=\"size-large wp-image-36074 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-15-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-15-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-15-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-15-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-15.jpg 1200w\" w